# Career Path Builder

## Education and Career: From Aspiration to an Achievable Plan

Career Path Builder is an AI-powered application that helps students transform their career aspirations into clear and achievable plans.

## Features

- Career Goal Analysis
- Personalized Career Roadmap
- Skill Development Plan
- Education and Learning Plan
- SMART Goals
- 3-Month, 6-Month and 1-Year Action Plans
- Weekly Study Planner
- Progress Tracker
- Challenges and Solutions
- AI Career Guidance Chat

## Objective

The main goal of this project is to help students understand their career path and take practical steps from aspiration to achievement.

## Technology

- Amazon PartyRock
- Generative AI
- GitHub
